 * Method :
 *    1.Reduced x to positive by atanh(-x) = -atanh(x)
 *    2.For x>=0.5
 *              1              2x                          x
 *  atanh(x) = --- * log(1 + -------) = 0.5 * log1p(2 * --------)
 *              2             1 - x                      1 - x
